# oracle: fix colvars components selfCoordNum (the pairs i < j of a 25-atom group; and of a 31-atom group with exponents 8/16 and a pair list with tolerance 0.002 rebuilt every 4 steps) and groupCoord (between two centres of mass) on the 256-atom LJ liquid of two masses, with a harmonic restraint on two of them and an upper wall on the third; fix_modify energy yes, two runs, the traj every 5 steps and the state every 20
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native: thermo 1.1e-14, final atoms 9.9e-14, traj and state files within 1e-10.
# oracle-inputs: w768cv_selfcoord.colvars
# oracle-files: scn.colvars.traj scn.colvars.state
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-10 filerel=1e-10
units           lj
atom_modify     map array
lattice         fcc 0.8442
region          box block 0 4 0 4 0 4
create_box      2 box
create_atoms    1 box
set             atom 1*128 type 2
mass            1 1.0
mass            2 2.5
velocity        all create 1.5 87287 loop geom
pair_style      lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff      * * 1.0 1.0 2.5
neighbor        0.3 bin
neigh_modify    every 1 delay 0 check yes
fix             1 all nve
fix             2 all colvars w768cv_selfcoord.colvars output scn
fix_modify      2 energy yes
thermo_style    custom step temp pe etotal f_2 f_2[1][1] f_2[2][1] f_2[3][1]
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          10
run             40
run             20
